---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaSection from '../components/CtaSection.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="How to Book Your Silk Road Tour" description="Learn how to book your Silk Road tour in 6 simple steps. Browse tours, submit inquiry, get customized itinerary, confirm deposit, and prepare for your adventure." ogImage="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg">
<section class="page-hero" style="background: url('/assets/images/xinjiang-landscape.jpg') center/cover;">
  <div class="container"><h1>How to Book</h1><p>Simple steps to plan and book your Silk Road adventure</p></div>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://silkroadwondertours.com/" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "How to Book" }
  ]
}
</script>
<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><div class="container"><a href="/">Home</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <span>How to Book</span></div></nav>

<!-- BOOKING STEPS -->
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-header reveal"><h2>6 Simple Steps to Your Silk Road Journey</h2><div class="divider"></div><p>From browsing tours to enjoying your trip, we make booking easy and stress-free</p></div>

<div class="booking-steps" style="max-width:900px;margin:50px auto 0;">
  <div class="booking-step reveal" style="display:flex;gap:28px;margin-bottom:40px;padding:32px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:12px;transition:transform 0.3s,box-shadow 0.3s;">
    <div style="flex-shrink:0;width:72px;height:72px;background:var(--gold,#c8a45c);border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;">1</div>
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size:22px;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:10px;">Browse & Choose</h3>
      <p style="color:#666;line-height:1.7;">Explore our carefully crafted Silk Road tour packages or tell us your travel ideas. Browse destinations from Xi'an to Kashgar, Dunhuang to Samarkand. Choose from group tours, private tours, or fully customized itineraries. If you don't find exactly what you're looking for, simply describe your dream trip and we'll create it for you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="booking-step reveal" style="display:flex;gap:28px;margin-bottom:40px;padding:32px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:12px;transition:transform 0.3s,box-shadow 0.3s;">
    <div style="flex-shrink:0;width:72px;height:72px;background:var(--gold,#c8a45c);border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;">2</div>
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size:22px;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:10px;">Submit Inquiry</h3>
      <p style="color:#666;line-height:1.7;">Fill out our inquiry form with your preferred travel dates, group size, accommodation preferences, and special interests. Tell us about your travel style — whether you prefer luxury hotels, boutique guesthouses, or a mix of both. The more details you provide, the better we can tailor your itinerary to your expectations.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="booking-step reveal" style="display:flex;gap:28px;margin-bottom:40px;padding:32px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:12px;transition:transform 0.3s,box-shadow 0.3s;">
    <div style="flex-shrink:0;width:72px;height:72px;background:var(--gold,#c8a45c);border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;">3</div>
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size:22px;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:10px;">Get Customized Itinerary</h3>
      <p style="color:#666;line-height:1.7;">Within 24 hours, your personal travel specialist will send you a detailed, customized itinerary. This includes day-by-day activities, recommended hotels, transportation arrangements, and a transparent cost breakdown. You can request unlimited revisions until the itinerary perfectly matches your vision.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="booking-step reveal" style="display:flex;gap:28px;margin-bottom:40px;padding:32px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:12px;transition:transform 0.3s,box-shadow 0.3s;">
    <div style="flex-shrink:0;width:72px;height:72px;background:var(--gold,#c8a45c);border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;">4</div>
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size:22px;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:10px;">Confirm & Pay Deposit</h3>
      <p style="color:#666;line-height:1.7;">Once you're satisfied with the itinerary, confirm your booking by paying a 30% deposit. We accept PayPal, credit cards (VISA/MasterCard), bank transfer, WeChat Pay, and Alipay. You'll receive an official booking confirmation and payment receipt immediately after the deposit is processed. The remaining 70% balance is due 30 days before departure.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="booking-step reveal" style="display:flex;gap:28px;margin-bottom:40px;padding:32px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:12px;transition:transform 0.3s,box-shadow 0.3s;">
    <div style="flex-shrink:0;width:72px;height:72px;background:var(--gold,#c8a45c);border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;">5</div>
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size:22px;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:10px;">Prepare for Travel</h3>
      <p style="color:#666;line-height:1.7;">We'll send you a comprehensive pre-departure guide covering visa requirements, packing suggestions, weather information, currency tips, and cultural etiquette. Your travel specialist remains available to answer any last-minute questions. We'll also provide your guide's contact information and a 24/7 emergency hotline number.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="booking-step reveal" style="display:flex;gap:28px;margin-bottom:40px;padding:32px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:12px;transition:transform 0.3s,box-shadow 0.3s;">
    <div style="flex-shrink:0;width:72px;height:72px;background:var(--gold,#c8a45c);border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;">6</div>
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-size:22px;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:10px;">Enjoy Your Trip</h3>
      <p style="color:#666;line-height:1.7;">Arrive in China and embark on your unforgettable Silk Road adventure! Your professional English-speaking guide and private driver will meet you at the airport. Throughout your journey, our operations team monitors your trip 24/7 to ensure everything runs smoothly. After your tour, share your experience and photos with us — we'd love to hear your stories!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div></section>

<!-- WHY BOOK WITH US -->
<section class="section section-alt"><div class="container"><div class="section-header reveal"><h2>Why Book With Silk Road Wonders</h2><div class="divider"></div></div>
<div class="why-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:40px;">
  <div class="why-card reveal" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:12px;padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
    <div style="font-size:40px;margin-bottom:12px;">✈</div>
    <h3 style="font-size:18px;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:8px;">Expertly Crafted Itineraries</h3>
    <p style="color:#666;">Every itinerary is designed by Silk Road specialists with 20+ years of experience.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="why-card reveal" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:12px;padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
    <div style="font-size:40px;margin-bottom:12px;">&#128101;</div>
    <h3 style="font-size:18px;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:8px;">Dedicated Travel Specialist</h3>
    <p style="color:#666;">One expert handles your trip from first inquiry to the day you return home.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="why-card reveal" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:12px;padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
    <div style="font-size:40px;margin-bottom:12px;">&#9200;</div>
    <h3 style="font-size:18px;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:8px;">24-Hour Response</h3>
    <p style="color:#666;">We respond to all inquiries within 24 hours with a detailed customized proposal.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="why-card reveal" style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:12px;padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
    <div style="font-size:40px;margin-bottom:12px;">&#128274;</div>
    <h3 style="font-size:18px;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:8px;">Secure Booking</h3>
    <p style="color:#666;">Your payments are protected with SSL encryption and trusted payment gateways.</p>
  </div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="cta-section"><div class="container"><div class="cta-grid">
  <div class="cta-text reveal"><h2>Ready to Start?</h2><p>Begin planning your Silk Road adventure today — submit your inquiry and we'll get back to you within 24 hours.</p><a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-gold">Contact Us Today</a></div>
</div></div></section>
<CtaSection />
</BaseLayout>